  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In the Unity 2022 open beta, the render resolution gets overridden after toggling fullscreen. \n\n1. Launch VRC with low resolution launch options like \"-screen-width 1600 -screen-height 900 -screen-fullscreen 0\"\n\n2. Toggle fullscreen on and then off (e.g. with Alt+Enter).\n\n3. The render resolution is now set to the fullscreen resolution instead of what was set by launch options.",
